Suggests: openssh-client
Description: Keyboard-driven console for OpenZFS — primitives, not a dashboard
 zxplore is a fast, keyboard-driven console for OpenZFS: browse datasets and
 snapshots with full property dossiers, replicate over SSH (encrypted
 datasets travel raw), restore files from any snapshot, and manage boot
 environments. Two binaries ship: zxplore (native Fyne GUI with a --tui
 terminal mode) and zxplore-tui (fully static, terminal only). Every action
 is a plain zfs/zpool command — a primitives tool, not a dashboard.
